---
// Type embedding promotion trap vs encapsulated private field + Functional Options pattern.
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="gaem">
  <div class="gaem-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Type embedding hazard where embedding sync.Mutex promotes Lock and Unlock to the public API versus encapsulating mu sync.Mutex as an unexported field and configuring optional settings with Functional Options.">
      {/* Left: Embedded Mutex / Time hazard */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gaem-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="gaem-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Unintentional promotion from embedding</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Lộ method ngoài ý muốn khi type embedding</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="64" width="394" height="92" rx="6" class="gaem-box" />
      <text x="44" y="88" class="gaem-b">type InMem struct {'{'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="110" class="gaem-b-red">  sync.Mutex   // embedded without field name</text>
      <text x="44" y="132" class="gaem-m">  items map[string]int</text>
      <text x="44" y="148" class="gaem-b">{'}'}</text>

      <rect x="30" y="172" width="394" height="102" rx="6" class="gaem-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="196" class="gaem-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>What callers suddenly inherit:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hậu quả caller bên ngoài vô tình thừa kế:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="218" class="gaem-m">• cache.Lock() / cache.Unlock() exposed publicly</text>
      <text x="44" y="238" class="gaem-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Embedding time.Time hijacks json.Marshaler!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Embed time.Time làm hỏng json.Marshal các field khác!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="258" class="gaem-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Embedding is composition, never inheritance</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Embedding chỉ là gộp struct, không phải kế thừa OOP</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Encapsulation + Functional Options */}
      <rect x="460" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gaem-card is-ok" />
      <text x="476" y="44" class="gaem-h-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Encapsulate locks + Functional Options</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Đóng gói lock + dùng Functional Options</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="64" width="394" height="92" rx="6" class="gaem-box" />
      <text x="490" y="88" class="gaem-b">type InMem struct {'{'}</text>
      <text x="490" y="110" class="gaem-ok">  mu sync.Mutex // unexported field</text>
      <text x="490" y="132" class="gaem-m">  port int; timeout time.Duration</text>
      <text x="490" y="148" class="gaem-b">{'}'}</text>

      <rect x="476" y="172" width="394" height="102" rx="6" class="gaem-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="196" class="gaem-ok">NewServer(addr, WithPort(8080), WithTLS())</text>
      <text x="490" y="218" class="gaem-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Zero-config defaults work out of the box</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Gọi NewServer(addr) vẫn chạy với giá trị mặc định</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="238" class="gaem-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Distinguishes omitted option vs explicit 0</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Phân biệt rõ không truyền vs truyền giá trị 0</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="258" class="gaem-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Validates option errors inside one constructor</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Gom việc kiểm tra lỗi option vào một chỗ duy nhất</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Left: embedding a type solely to save keystrokes leaks internal locks or overrides interfaces like json.Marshaler. Right: keep internal mutexes unexported and pass optional configuration via Functional Options.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trái: nhúng kiểu dữ liệu chỉ để đỡ gõ chữ vô tình làm lộ mutex nội bộ hoặc ghi đè interface như json.Marshaler. Phải: đặt mutex làm trường ẩn và cấu hình tùy chọn qua Functional Options.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gaem { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gaem-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gaem svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gaem text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gaem-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gaem-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gaem-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gaem-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gaem-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gaem-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gaem-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gaem-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gaem-h-red { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gaem-h-ok { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gaem-h-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gaem-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gaem-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gaem-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gaem-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gaem-m { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gaem figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
